  "description": "Jeong Da-Um is a beta. There’s nothing wrong with that, per se, but it’s what drives him to quit his job as an idol to become a manager at an entertainment agency. There, he’s determined to live an ordinary life, but that’s pretty hard to do when you become the manager of Lee Yeon, an actor with a large fan following and an even larger reputation as a prickly alpha. When Yeon goes into an unexpected rut, Da-Um’s life very quickly starts getting out of the ordinary... \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
